{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0158VBMZcy2LtSCKHrVGoSa6","type":"tool_result","content":"100\t      - 0.012\n101\t      - 0.108\n102\t      s025:\n103\t      - 0.055\n104\t      - 0.28\n105\t      s030:\n106\t      - 0.18\n107\t      - 0.62\n108\t    wilcoxon_p:\n109\t      s015: 0.018\n110\t      s020: 0.004\n111\t      s025: 0.00035\n112\t      s030: 1.8e-05\n113\t    wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n114\t      s015: 0.072\n115\t      s020: 0.016\n116\t      s025: 0.0014\n117\t      s030: 7.2e-05\n118\t    significant_bonferroni:\n119\t      s015: false\n120\t      s020: true\n121\t      s025: true\n122\t      s030: true\n123\t    bonferroni_significant_count: 3\n124\t    cross_arch_comparison:\n125\t      deepseek_qwen2_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030: 0.8\n126\t      llama_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030: 0.52\n127\t      delta: 0.28\n128\t      note: 'LLaMA effect weaker than Qwen2 architecture but now unambiguously medium\n129\t        (d_z=0.52, CI excludes zero). Architecture modulates magnitude but not direction\n130\t        — strategy×phase interaction is a general phenomenon.\n131\t\n132\t        '\n133\t  result_rationale: 'n=50时imp_vs_rand d_z=0.19→0.34，CI极宽（s030 CI=[0.06,0.66]），统计功效不足。\n134\t    n=250使SE缩小√5≈2.24倍，效应量估计趋于真值。 关键推理：(1) n=50时random phase gradient d_z=0.35-0.44可能被采样变异性膨胀——\n135\t    random masking本质是无差别噪声注入，不应产生与importance同等的strategy-dependent phase调制。在n=250下，采样噪声被平滑，random\n136\t    d_z回落至~0.15-0.22，不再Bonferroni显著。 这与DS/QW在低sparsity下random NS的模式一致——n=50时LLaMA\n137\t    random显著是Type I error 因小样本变异性所致。(2) importance的phase gradient在LLaMA上始终强烈（d_z≈1.0，\n138\t    源于LLaMA架构的attention head数量28/层 vs Qwen2的28/层但GQA结构不同）， n=250确认这不是偶然。(3) imp_vs_rand\n139\t    d_z在n=250下稳定至0.24→0.52， s020/s025/s030三个水平Bonferroni显著，因为真效应在这些水平上为medium（d_z≈0.35-0.55），\n140\t    n=250给出>90%的功效。\n141\t\n142\t    '\n143\t  tables:\n144\t  - name: 'Table: LLaMA n=250 vs n=50 Effect Size Comparison'\n145\t    columns:\n146\t    - sparsity\n147\t    - n50_dz\n148\t    - n250_dz\n149\t    - n250_bonf_p\n150\t    - n250_significant\n151\t    rows:\n152\t    - - s015\n153\t      - 0.19\n154\t      - 0.24\n155\t      - 0.072\n156\t      - NS\n157\t    - - s020\n158\t      - 0.26\n159\t      - 0.33\n160\t      - 0.016\n161\t      - ✓\n162\t    - - s025\n163\t      - 0.29\n164\t      - 0.43\n165\t      - 0.0014\n166\t      - ✓\n167\t    - - s030\n168\t      - 0.34\n169\t      - 0.52\n170\t      - 7.2e-05\n171\t      - ✓\n172\t  - name: 'Table: Random Phase Gradient Attenuation (n=50 → n=250)'\n173\t    columns:\n174\t    - sparsity\n175\t    - n50_random_dz\n176\t    - n250_random_dz\n177\t    - n250_random_CI_contains_zero\n178\t    rows:\n179\t    - - s015\n180\t      - 0.35\n181\t      - 0.15\n182\t      - 'yes'\n183\t    - - s020\n184\t      - 0.37\n185\t      - 0.18\n186\t      - borderline\n187\t    - - s025\n188\t      - 0.45\n189\t      - 0.21\n190\t      - no (but not Bonf)\n191\t    - - s030\n192\t      - 0.44\n193\t      - 0.22\n194\t      - no (but not Bonf)\n195\t  figures_description:\n196\t  - 'fig_c8_n250_dz_comparison.pdf: 左panel=imp_vs_rand d_z随sparsity变化（n=50虚线 vs n=250实线，含CI\n197\t    band），右panel=random phase gradient d_z的n=50→n=250衰减，灰色区域标注Bonferroni显著阈值'\n198\t  - 'fig_c8_cross_arch_forest.pdf: Forest plot展示三架构(DS/QW/LLaMA)在4个sparsity水平的imp_vs_rand\n199\t    d_z及95% CI'\n200\t  analysis: 'LLaMA n=250结果解除了C8的architecture-dependent限定。三个关键变化： (1) imp_vs_rand d_z从n=50的仅s030\n201\t    Bonferroni显著(p=0.029)提升至3个水平显著 (s020 p=0.016, s025 p=0.001, s030 p<0.001)； (2)\n202\t    s030 d_z=0.52（medium effect），在best范围[0.4,0.65]内； (3) random phase gradient从d_z=0.35-0.44衰减至0.15-0.22，无一Bonferroni显著——\n203\t    这与DS/QW模式一致，排除了\"LLaMA上random也strategy-dependent\"的alternative explanation。 论文可删除\"suggests\"/\"provides\n204\t    partial support\"措辞，改为 \"Cross-architecture validation on LLaMA (n=250) confirms\n205\t    strategy×phase interaction with medium effect size (d_z=0.52 at s=0.30, Bonferroni\n206\t    p<0.001)\"。 Limitation仅保留magnitude差异（LLaMA d_z=0.52 vs Qwen2 d_z=0.80）。\n207\t\n208\t    '\n209\t- name: GPQA DeepSeek Importance Phase Gradient Profiling\n210\t  plan_id: gpqa_profiling_ds\n211\t  description: '在DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B上对GPQA-Diamond子集(n=50)运行importance masking\n212\t    across 4 sparsity levels (s015/s020/s025/s030)，验证phase gradient单调递增。\n213\t\n214\t    '\n215\t  expected_results:\n216\t    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n217\t    benchmark: GPQA-Diamond\n218\t    n_problems: 50\n219\t    method: median + Wilcoxon + bootstrap_median(B=10000)\n220\t    importance:\n221\t      s015:\n222\t        median_gradient: 0.185\n223\t        ci_low: 0.062\n224\t        ci_high: 0.385\n225\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0008\n226\t      s020:\n227\t        median_gradient: 0.582\n228\t        ci_low: 0.241\n229\t        ci_high: 0.935\n230\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0002\n231\t      s025:\n232\t        median_gradient: 1.748\n233\t        ci_low: 0.82\n234\t        ci_high: 2.51\n235\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n236\t      s030:\n237\t        median_gradient: 4.105\n238\t        ci_low: 1.89\n239\t        ci_high: 8.82\n240\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n241\t    dose_response_monotonic: true\n242\t    spearman_rho: 1.0\n243\t    cross_benchmark_comparison:\n244\t      math500_ds_gradient_s030: 8.48\n245\t      gsm8k_ds_gradient_s030: 4.682\n246\t      gpqa_ds_gradient_s030: 4.105\n247\t      note: GPQA gradient magnitude between MATH-500 and GSM8K\n248\t  result_rationale: 'GPQA-Diamond是graduate-level科学推理任务，难度高于MATH-500。预测phase gradient\n249\t    单调递增的理由：(1) GPQA的reasoning chain通常较长（涉及多步科学推理）， 大量token落入low-sparsity phase——head\n250\t    pruning在这些phase中导致importance score 的discrimination collapse更严重，compound interaction因此更大；\n251\t    (2) DS在MATH-500上gradient为0.39→8.48，GSM8K上为0.241→4.682——GPQA预计 在两者之间（~0.19→4.10），因为GPQA虽然难度高但问题更短（多选题format），\n252\t    reasoning chain长度介于MATH和GSM之间； (3) 单调性在三个benchmark上一致，因为phase gradient的物理机制（discrimination\n253\t    collapse 在late phase最严重→compound interaction在low-sparsity phase最大）不依赖于task类型。\n254\t\n255\t    '\n256\t  tables:\n257\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient Comparison (DeepSeek)'\n258\t    columns:\n259\t    - sparsity\n260\t    - MATH-500\n261\t    - GSM8K\n262\t    - GPQA\n263\t    rows:\n264\t    - - s015\n265\t      - 0.39\n266\t      - 0.241\n267\t      - 0.185\n268\t    - - s020\n269\t      - 1.21\n270\t      - 0.74\n271\t      - 0.582\n272\t    - - s025\n273\t      - 3.99\n274\t      - 1.992\n275\t      - 1.748\n276\t    - - s030\n277\t      - 8.48\n278\t      - 4.682\n279\t      - 4.105\n280\t  figures_description:\n281\t  - 'fig_cross_benchmark_gradient.pdf: 三条线(MATH/GSM/GPQA)展示DS importance phase gradient随sparsity的dose-response曲线，标注均为单调递增'\n282\t  analysis: 'GPQA上DS importance phase gradient 0.185→4.105单调递增，Spearman ρ=1.0， 复现了MATH-500和GSM8K上的核心发现。Gradient\n283\t    magnitude介于MATH-500(8.48) 和GSM8K(4.682)之间，反映GPQA推理链长度的中间特性。 三benchmark全部单调递增（cross_benchmark_phase_gradient_monotonic_count=3），\n284\t    确认phase modulation是跨task的robust finding。\n285\t\n286\t    '\n287\t- name: GPQA Qwen Importance Phase Gradient Profiling\n288\t  plan_id: gpqa_profiling_qw\n289\t  description: '在Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct上对GPQA-Diamond(n=50)运行importance masking across\n290\t    4 sparsity levels，验证cross-model replication。\n291\t\n292\t    '\n293\t  expected_results:\n294\t    model: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n295\t    benchmark: GPQA-Diamond\n296\t    n_problems: 50\n297\t    importance:\n298\t      s015:\n299\t        median_gradient: 0.042"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8ea52053-5c5d-477c-85fd-15c4d095d3f8","uuid":"4a38f90e-6a51-4a09-9404-433d1eb572a9","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:06:54.125Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073742/best/imagined_experiments.yaml","content":"      - 0.012\n      - 0.108\n      s025:\n      - 0.055\n      - 0.28\n      s030:\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.62\n    wilcoxon_p:\n      s015: 0.018\n      s020: 0.004\n      s025: 0.00035\n      s030: 1.8e-05\n    wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n      s015: 0.072\n      s020: 0.016\n      s025: 0.0014\n      s030: 7.2e-05\n    significant_bonferroni:\n      s015: false\n      s020: true\n      s025: true\n      s030: true\n    bonferroni_significant_count: 3\n    cross_arch_comparison:\n      deepseek_qwen2_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030: 0.8\n      llama_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030: 0.52\n      delta: 0.28\n      note: 'LLaMA effect weaker than Qwen2 architecture but now unambiguously medium\n        (d_z=0.52, CI excludes zero). Architecture modulates magnitude but not direction\n        — strategy×phase interaction is a general phenomenon.\n\n        '\n  result_rationale: 'n=50时imp_vs_rand d_z=0.19→0.34，CI极宽（s030 CI=[0.06,0.66]），统计功效不足。\n    n=250使SE缩小√5≈2.24倍，效应量估计趋于真值。 关键推理：(1) n=50时random phase gradient d_z=0.35-0.44可能被采样变异性膨胀——\n    random masking本质是无差别噪声注入，不应产生与importance同等的strategy-dependent phase调制。在n=250下，采样噪声被平滑，random\n    d_z回落至~0.15-0.22，不再Bonferroni显著。 这与DS/QW在低sparsity下random NS的模式一致——n=50时LLaMA\n    random显著是Type I error 因小样本变异性所致。(2) importance的phase gradient在LLaMA上始终强烈（d_z≈1.0，\n    源于LLaMA架构的attention head数量28/层 vs Qwen2的28/层但GQA结构不同）， n=250确认这不是偶然。(3) imp_vs_rand\n    d_z在n=250下稳定至0.24→0.52， s020/s025/s030三个水平Bonferroni显著，因为真效应在这些水平上为medium（d_z≈0.35-0.55），\n    n=250给出>90%的功效。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: LLaMA n=250 vs n=50 Effect Size Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - n50_dz\n    - n250_dz\n    - n250_bonf_p\n    - n250_significant\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.19\n      - 0.24\n      - 0.072\n      - NS\n    - - s020\n      - 0.26\n      - 0.33\n      - 0.016\n      - ✓\n    - - s025\n      - 0.29\n      - 0.43\n      - 0.0014\n      - ✓\n    - - s030\n      - 0.34\n      - 0.52\n      - 7.2e-05\n      - ✓\n  - name: 'Table: Random Phase Gradient Attenuation (n=50 → n=250)'\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - n50_random_dz\n    - n250_random_dz\n    - n250_random_CI_contains_zero\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.15\n      - 'yes'\n    - - s020\n      - 0.37\n      - 0.18\n      - borderline\n    - - s025\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.21\n      - no (but not Bonf)\n    - - s030\n      - 0.44\n      - 0.22\n      - no (but not Bonf)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'fig_c8_n250_dz_comparison.pdf: 左panel=imp_vs_rand d_z随sparsity变化（n=50虚线 vs n=250实线，含CI\n    band），右panel=random phase gradient d_z的n=50→n=250衰减，灰色区域标注Bonferroni显著阈值'\n  - 'fig_c8_cross_arch_forest.pdf: Forest plot展示三架构(DS/QW/LLaMA)在4个sparsity水平的imp_vs_rand\n    d_z及95% CI'\n  analysis: 'LLaMA n=250结果解除了C8的architecture-dependent限定。三个关键变化： (1) imp_vs_rand d_z从n=50的仅s030\n    Bonferroni显著(p=0.029)提升至3个水平显著 (s020 p=0.016, s025 p=0.001, s030 p<0.001)； (2)\n    s030 d_z=0.52（medium effect），在best范围[0.4,0.65]内； (3) random phase gradient从d_z=0.35-0.44衰减至0.15-0.22，无一Bonferroni显著——\n    这与DS/QW模式一致，排除了\"LLaMA上random也strategy-dependent\"的alternative explanation。 论文可删除\"suggests\"/\"provides\n    partial support\"措辞，改为 \"Cross-architecture validation on LLaMA (n=250) confirms\n    strategy×phase interaction with medium effect size (d_z=0.52 at s=0.30, Bonferroni\n    p<0.001)\"。 Limitation仅保留magnitude差异（LLaMA d_z=0.52 vs Qwen2 d_z=0.80）。\n\n    '\n- name: GPQA DeepSeek Importance Phase Gradient Profiling\n  plan_id: gpqa_profiling_ds\n  description: '在DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B上对GPQA-Diamond子集(n=50)运行importance masking\n    across 4 sparsity levels (s015/s020/s025/s030)，验证phase gradient单调递增。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n    benchmark: GPQA-Diamond\n    n_problems: 50\n    method: median + Wilcoxon + bootstrap_median(B=10000)\n    importance:\n      s015:\n        median_gradient: 0.185\n        ci_low: 0.062\n        ci_high: 0.385\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0008\n      s020:\n        median_gradient: 0.582\n        ci_low: 0.241\n        ci_high: 0.935\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0002\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 1.748\n        ci_low: 0.82\n        ci_high: 2.51\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 4.105\n        ci_low: 1.89\n        ci_high: 8.82\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n    dose_response_monotonic: true\n    spearman_rho: 1.0\n    cross_benchmark_comparison:\n      math500_ds_gradient_s030: 8.48\n      gsm8k_ds_gradient_s030: 4.682\n      gpqa_ds_gradient_s030: 4.105\n      note: GPQA gradient magnitude between MATH-500 and GSM8K\n  result_rationale: 'GPQA-Diamond是graduate-level科学推理任务，难度高于MATH-500。预测phase gradient\n    单调递增的理由：(1) GPQA的reasoning chain通常较长（涉及多步科学推理）， 大量token落入low-sparsity phase——head\n    pruning在这些phase中导致importance score 的discrimination collapse更严重，compound interaction因此更大；\n    (2) DS在MATH-500上gradient为0.39→8.48，GSM8K上为0.241→4.682——GPQA预计 在两者之间（~0.19→4.10），因为GPQA虽然难度高但问题更短（多选题format），\n    reasoning chain长度介于MATH和GSM之间； (3) 单调性在三个benchmark上一致，因为phase gradient的物理机制（discrimination\n    collapse 在late phase最严重→compound interaction在low-sparsity phase最大）不依赖于task类型。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient Comparison (DeepSeek)'\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - MATH-500\n    - GSM8K\n    - GPQA\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.39\n      - 0.241\n      - 0.185\n    - - s020\n      - 1.21\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.582\n    - - s025\n      - 3.99\n      - 1.992\n      - 1.748\n    - - s030\n      - 8.48\n      - 4.682\n      - 4.105\n  figures_description:\n  - 'fig_cross_benchmark_gradient.pdf: 三条线(MATH/GSM/GPQA)展示DS importance phase gradient随sparsity的dose-response曲线，标注均为单调递增'\n  analysis: 'GPQA上DS importance phase gradient 0.185→4.105单调递增，Spearman ρ=1.0， 复现了MATH-500和GSM8K上的核心发现。Gradient\n    magnitude介于MATH-500(8.48) 和GSM8K(4.682)之间，反映GPQA推理链长度的中间特性。 三benchmark全部单调递增（cross_benchmark_phase_gradient_monotonic_count=3），\n    确认phase modulation是跨task的robust finding。\n\n    '\n- name: GPQA Qwen Importance Phase Gradient Profiling\n  plan_id: gpqa_profiling_qw\n  description: '在Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct上对GPQA-Diamond(n=50)运行importance masking across\n    4 sparsity levels，验证cross-model replication。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n    benchmark: GPQA-Diamond\n    n_problems: 50\n    importance:\n      s015:\n        median_gradient: 0.042","numLines":200,"startLine":100,"totalLines":703}}}
