{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017yZPLNif6ioLvE7xNvb6Ni","type":"tool_result","content":"298\t      s015:\n299\t        median_gradient: 0.042\n300\t        ci_low: 0.008\n301\t        ci_high: 0.095\n302\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.015\n303\t      s020:\n304\t        median_gradient: 0.195\n305\t        ci_low: 0.078\n306\t        ci_high: 0.358\n307\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0005\n308\t      s025:\n309\t        median_gradient: 0.882\n310\t        ci_low: 0.45\n311\t        ci_high: 1.32\n312\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n313\t      s030:\n314\t        median_gradient: 2.35\n315\t        ci_low: 1.28\n316\t        ci_high: 3.68\n317\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n318\t    dose_response_monotonic: true\n319\t    spearman_rho: 1.0\n320\t    qw_ds_gradient_ratio_s030: 0.57\n321\t    note: QW magnitude ~57% of DS, consistent with MATH-500 pattern (QW ~37% of DS)\n322\t  result_rationale: 'QW在MATH-500上gradient为0.066→3.155（DS的~37%），在GSM8K上为0.039→2.092。\n323\t    GPQA预测QW gradient 0.042→2.350，DS比QW比值约1.75×，略低于MATH-500的2.7×但 高于GSM8K的2.2×。QW\n324\t    magnitude一贯小于DS（可能因Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct的 attention head utilization更均匀，pruning影响较分散），但方向和单调性完全一致。\n325\t    Onset threshold仍在s020+——s015 gradient仅0.042但CI不跨零（GPQA难度使得即使 低sparsity也有可检测的compound\n326\t    effect）。\n327\t\n328\t    '\n329\t  tables:\n330\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient Comparison (Qwen)'\n331\t    columns:\n332\t    - sparsity\n333\t    - MATH-500\n334\t    - GSM8K\n335\t    - GPQA\n336\t    rows:\n337\t    - - s015\n338\t      - 0.066\n339\t      - 0.039\n340\t      - 0.042\n341\t    - - s020\n342\t      - 0.307\n343\t      - 0.158\n344\t      - 0.195\n345\t    - - s025\n346\t      - 1.075\n347\t      - 1.1\n348\t      - 0.882\n349\t    - - s030\n350\t      - 3.155\n351\t      - 2.092\n352\t      - 2.35\n353\t  figures_description:\n354\t  - 'fig_qw_cross_benchmark.pdf: 与DS对应的QW三benchmark gradient曲线'\n355\t  analysis: 'QW在GPQA上完美复现单调递增模式。结合DS，两模型×三benchmark共6个 dose-response曲线全部单调（Spearman\n356\t    ρ=1.0）。QW-GPQA的gradient magnitude 与QW-GSM8K接近（s030: 2.35 vs 2.09），暗示QW在不同推理任务上的compound\n357\t    sensitivity较为稳定，而DS variation更大（MATH=8.48, GSM=4.68, GPQA=4.10）。\n358\t\n359\t    '\n360\t- name: GPQA Random Baselines and Strategy Specificity Ratio\n361\t  plan_id: gpqa_random_baselines\n362\t  description: '在GPQA-Diamond(n=50)上对DS和QW运行random masking across 4 sparsity levels，\n363\t    计算strategy specificity ratio (importance/random gradient)，验证≥5×。\n364\t\n365\t    '\n366\t  expected_results:\n367\t    ds_random:\n368\t      s015:\n369\t        median_gradient: 0.022\n370\t      s020:\n371\t        median_gradient: 0.068\n372\t      s025:\n373\t        median_gradient: 0.232\n374\t      s030:\n375\t        median_gradient: 0.548\n376\t    qw_random:\n377\t      s015:\n378\t        median_gradient: 0.006\n379\t      s020:\n380\t        median_gradient: 0.028\n381\t      s025:\n382\t        median_gradient: 0.125\n383\t      s030:\n384\t        median_gradient: 0.38\n385\t    strategy_specificity_ratio_ds:\n386\t      s015: 8.4\n387\t      s020: 8.6\n388\t      s025: 7.5\n389\t      s030: 7.5\n390\t    strategy_specificity_ratio_qw:\n391\t      s015: 7.0\n392\t      s020: 7.0\n393\t      s025: 7.1\n394\t      s030: 6.2\n395\t    strategy_specificity_ratio_range: 6.2-8.6×\n396\t    all_ratios_above_5x: true\n397\t    cross_benchmark_specificity_comparison:\n398\t      math500: 15-36×\n399\t      gsm8k: 2.3-3.8×\n400\t      gpqa: 6.2-8.6×\n401\t  result_rationale: 'Strategy specificity ratio的task-dependence与reasoning chain结构相关：\n402\t    (1) MATH-500推理链最长最复杂（竞赛数学），importance score的phase-dependent discrimination collapse最剧烈→ratio最高（15-36×）；\n403\t    (2) GSM8K推理链最短最规律（小学数学），importance和random的差异被压缩→ratio 最低（2.3-3.8×）； (3) GPQA居中（graduate\n404\t    QA，推理步骤中等长度），ratio 6.2-8.6×。 所有GPQA ratio≥5×，满足best tier阈值。物理解释：GPQA的scientific\n405\t    reasoning 涉及领域知识检索和逻辑链推理，importance score对这些pattern的编码比 random有明显优势，但不如MATH-500中复杂数学推理的优势大。\n406\t    random baseline在GPQA上仍产生可测量的compound effect（特别是s025+）， 但magnitude远小于importance——与DS/QW在MATH-500上的模式定性一致。\n407\t\n408\t    '\n409\t  tables:\n410\t  - name: 'Table: Strategy Specificity Ratio Across Benchmarks'\n411\t    columns:\n412\t    - benchmark\n413\t    - ratio_range\n414\t    - interpretation\n415\t    rows:\n416\t    - - MATH-500\n417\t      - 15-36×\n418\t      - very_high\n419\t    - - GPQA\n420\t      - 6.2-8.6×\n421\t      - high\n422\t    - - GSM8K\n423\t      - 2.3-3.8×\n424\t      - moderate\n425\t  figures_description:\n426\t  - 'fig_specificity_heatmap.pdf: 3×4 heatmap (benchmark × sparsity) 展示strategy specificity\n427\t    ratio，颜色从蓝(2×)到红(36×)，标注5×阈值线'\n428\t  - 'fig_gpqa_imp_vs_rand.pdf: GPQA上importance vs random gradient的双线图（DS和QW各一个panel），阴影区域表示两者差距'\n429\t  analysis: 'GPQA strategy specificity ratio 6.2-8.6×，全部超过5×阈值。 与MATH-500(15-36×)和GSM8K(2.3-3.8×)形成interpretable\n430\t    gradient： 推理链复杂度↑ → specificity ratio↑。这支持\"discrimination collapse是 mechanism、而非importance\n431\t    metric本身有缺陷\"的framing——如果是metric缺陷， ratio不应随task difficulty系统性变化。Strategy specificity的task-dependence\n432\t    机制现在有了三点数据（从moderate到very_high），可以在Discussion中 提出\"推理链复杂度调制specificity\"的初步假说。\n433\t\n434\t    '\n435\t- name: Discrimination Collapse Quantitative Correlation Analysis\n436\t  plan_id: mechanism_gini_correlation\n437\t  description: '利用已完成的c5_per_phase_gini和c2_n500数据，计算per-phase Gini_delta 与interaction\n438\t    severity（II median）的跨模型定量相关，验证r≥0.7。\n439\t\n440\t    '\n441\t  expected_results:\n442\t    analysis_type: correlation of per-phase Gini collapse magnitude with II severity\n443\t    data_source: c5_per_phase_gini (n=30 per model) + c2_n500 (n=500 per model)\n444\t    ds_within_model:\n445\t      gini_delta_low_phase:\n446\t      - -0.0163\n447\t      - -0.0209\n448\t      - -0.0313\n449\t      - -0.0373\n450\t      ii_median:\n451\t      - 0.3907\n452\t      - 1.2149\n453\t      - 3.9857\n454\t      - 8.4813\n455\t      spearman_rho: 1.0\n456\t      pearson_r: 0.93\n457\t      pearson_p: 0.035\n458\t    qw_within_model:\n459\t      gini_delta_low_phase:\n460\t      - -0.0165\n461\t      - -0.02\n462\t      - -0.0286\n463\t      - -0.035\n464\t      ii_median:\n465\t      - 0.0659\n466\t      - 0.3073\n467\t      - 1.0745\n468\t      - 3.155\n469\t      spearman_rho: 1.0\n470\t      pearson_r: 0.95\n471\t      pearson_p: 0.025\n472\t    cross_model_pooled:\n473\t      n_datapoints: 8\n474\t      spearman_rho: 0.88\n475\t      pearson_r: 0.85\n476\t      pearson_p: 0.004\n477\t    cv_correlation:\n478\t      ds_cv_delta_vs_ii_spearman: 1.0\n479\t      qw_cv_delta_vs_ii_spearman: 1.0\n480\t      cross_model_cv_pearson_r: 0.87\n481\t    llama_validation:\n482\t      note: 'LLaMA c8_llama_n250 data可进一步验证——如果LLaMA per-phase Gini也 与II monotonically相关，则三模型cross-model\n483\t        r预计提升至0.88+\n484\t\n485\t        '\n486\t      llama_predicted_gini_delta_low_phase:\n487\t      - -0.012\n488\t      - -0.016\n489\t      - -0.022\n490\t      - -0.028\n491\t      llama_predicted_ii_from_n250:\n492\t      - 0.025\n493\t      - 0.052\n494\t      - 0.148\n495\t      - 0.415\n496\t      llama_predicted_within_r: 0.91\n497\t  result_rationale: 'Gini delta和II的相关性有坚实的机制基础：head pruning → 剩余head的importance score分布变得更均匀（Gini下降）→\n498\t    importance-based eviction丧失判别力 → eviction近似随机 → compound interaction增大。因此Gini下降幅度应与II\n499\t    severity 正相关。具体地： (1) DS low-phase Gini delta [-0.016→-0.037] 与 II [0.39→8.48]\n500\t    完美单调共变 （Spearman ρ=1.0），Pearson r=0.93源于两者均近似幂律增长但指数不同； (2) QW同样单调（Gini [-0.017→-0.035]，II\n501\t    [0.066→3.155]），Pearson r略高(0.95) 因为QW的II增长更接近线性（log-scale上更平缓）； (3) 跨模型pooling(8点)r=0.85，因为DS和QW的Gini-magnitude关系有共同的正趋势\n502\t    但斜率不同（DS单位Gini下降对应更大的II增加），这正好反映两模型architecture 差异——Gini→II的传递函数是architecture-dependent的，但方向和monotonicity\n503\t    是universal的。 所有r>0.7，满足best tier要求。CV delta提供一致的supporting evidence。\n504\t\n505\t    '\n506\t  tables:\n507\t  - name: 'Table: Gini-II Correlation Summary'\n508\t    columns:\n509\t    - scope\n510\t    - Spearman ρ\n511\t    - Pearson r\n512\t    - p-value\n513\t    - interpretation\n514\t    rows:\n515\t    - - DS within-model\n516\t      - 1.0\n517\t      - 0.93\n518\t      - 0.035\n519\t      - strong monotonic\n520\t    - - QW within-model\n521\t      - 1.0\n522\t      - 0.95\n523\t      - 0.025\n524\t      - strong monotonic\n525\t    - - Cross-model pooled\n526\t      - 0.88\n527\t      - 0.85\n528\t      - 0.004\n529\t      - robust cross-model\n530\t  - name: 'Table: Per-Phase Gini Delta vs II Median (Low-Phase)'\n531\t    columns:\n532\t    - model\n533\t    - sparsity\n534\t    - gini_delta\n535\t    - ii_median\n536\t    rows:\n537\t    - - DS\n538\t      - s015\n539\t      - -0.0163\n540\t      - 0.3907\n541\t    - - DS\n542\t      - s020\n543\t      - -0.0209\n544\t      - 1.2149\n545\t    - - DS\n546\t      - s025\n547\t      - -0.0313\n548\t      - 3.9857\n549\t    - - DS\n550\t      - s030\n551\t      - -0.0373\n552\t      - 8.4813\n553\t    - - QW\n554\t      - s015\n555\t      - -0.0165\n556\t      - 0.0659\n557\t    - - QW\n558\t      - s020\n559\t      - -0.02\n560\t      - 0.3073\n561\t    - - QW\n562\t      - s025\n563\t      - -0.0286\n564\t      - 1.0745\n565\t    - - QW\n566\t      - s030\n567\t      - -0.035\n568\t      - 3.155\n569\t  figures_description:\n570\t  - 'fig_gini_ii_scatter.pdf: 散点图展示|Gini_delta|(x轴) vs II_median(y轴,log scale)，DS圆点QW方块，按sparsity着色（浅→深），回归线及r²标注'\n571\t  - 'fig_mechanism_schematic.pdf: 因果链示意图：head pruning → Gini↓ → discrimination collapse\n572\t    → compound II↑，箭头上标注cross-model r值'\n573\t  analysis: 'Per-phase Gini delta与II severity的定量相关是discrimination collapse假说的 最终实证验证。DS和QW各4个sparsity水平给出8个数据点，跨模型Pearson\n574\t    r=0.85, Spearman ρ=0.88，远超r≥0.7阈值。更重要的是： (1) 两模型within-model ρ均为1.0（完美单调），排除了\"Gini下降但II不增加\"\n575\t    或\"II增加但Gini不下降\"的反例； (2) Pearson r<1.0源于非线性关系（II随Gini近似幂律增长），这恰好与 discrimination\n576\t    collapse机制的非线性传递函数一致——Gini小幅下降在接近 临界阈值时引发不成比例的判别力崩塌； (3) CV delta给出一致结果（r=0.87），提供converging\n577\t    evidence。 论文§5 Mechanism可以声明\"Gini decline quantitatively predicts interaction\n578\t    severity (cross-model r=0.85, p=0.004)\"。\n579\t\n580\t    '\n581\t- name: Language Switching at Intermediate Sparsities (s020/s025)\n582\t  plan_id: c10_lang_s020_s025\n583\t  description: '填补s020和s025的language switching rate数据（当前已有dense=0%, s015=4%, s030=40%），确认monotonic\n584\t    dose-response。\n585\t\n586\t    '\n587\t  expected_results:\n588\t    method: CPU analysis of gen_snippet data\n589\t    n_per_sparsity: 50\n590\t    s020:\n591\t      switch_rate: 0.12\n592\t      cn_count: 6\n593\t      en_count: 44\n594\t      cn_acc: 0.0\n595\t      en_acc: 0.3\n596\t    s025:\n597\t      switch_rate: 0.26"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8ea52053-5c5d-477c-85fd-15c4d095d3f8","uuid":"e16d1b77-5c1e-4772-92c2-25ea8e4452e1","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:06:57.607Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073742/best/imagined_experiments.yaml","content":"      s015:\n        median_gradient: 0.042\n        ci_low: 0.008\n        ci_high: 0.095\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.015\n      s020:\n        median_gradient: 0.195\n        ci_low: 0.078\n        ci_high: 0.358\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0005\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 0.882\n        ci_low: 0.45\n        ci_high: 1.32\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 2.35\n        ci_low: 1.28\n        ci_high: 3.68\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n    dose_response_monotonic: true\n    spearman_rho: 1.0\n    qw_ds_gradient_ratio_s030: 0.57\n    note: QW magnitude ~57% of DS, consistent with MATH-500 pattern (QW ~37% of DS)\n  result_rationale: 'QW在MATH-500上gradient为0.066→3.155（DS的~37%），在GSM8K上为0.039→2.092。\n    GPQA预测QW gradient 0.042→2.350，DS比QW比值约1.75×，略低于MATH-500的2.7×但 高于GSM8K的2.2×。QW\n    magnitude一贯小于DS（可能因Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct的 attention head utilization更均匀，pruning影响较分散），但方向和单调性完全一致。\n    Onset threshold仍在s020+——s015 gradient仅0.042但CI不跨零（GPQA难度使得即使 低sparsity也有可检测的compound\n    effect）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient Comparison (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - MATH-500\n    - GSM8K\n    - GPQA\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.066\n      - 0.039\n      - 0.042\n    - - s020\n      - 0.307\n      - 0.158\n      - 0.195\n    - - s025\n      - 1.075\n      - 1.1\n      - 0.882\n    - - s030\n      - 3.155\n      - 2.092\n      - 2.35\n  figures_description:\n  - 'fig_qw_cross_benchmark.pdf: 与DS对应的QW三benchmark gradient曲线'\n  analysis: 'QW在GPQA上完美复现单调递增模式。结合DS，两模型×三benchmark共6个 dose-response曲线全部单调（Spearman\n    ρ=1.0）。QW-GPQA的gradient magnitude 与QW-GSM8K接近（s030: 2.35 vs 2.09），暗示QW在不同推理任务上的compound\n    sensitivity较为稳定，而DS variation更大（MATH=8.48, GSM=4.68, GPQA=4.10）。\n\n    '\n- name: GPQA Random Baselines and Strategy Specificity Ratio\n  plan_id: gpqa_random_baselines\n  description: '在GPQA-Diamond(n=50)上对DS和QW运行random masking across 4 sparsity levels，\n    计算strategy specificity ratio (importance/random gradient)，验证≥5×。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ds_random:\n      s015:\n        median_gradient: 0.022\n      s020:\n        median_gradient: 0.068\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 0.232\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 0.548\n    qw_random:\n      s015:\n        median_gradient: 0.006\n      s020:\n        median_gradient: 0.028\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 0.125\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 0.38\n    strategy_specificity_ratio_ds:\n      s015: 8.4\n      s020: 8.6\n      s025: 7.5\n      s030: 7.5\n    strategy_specificity_ratio_qw:\n      s015: 7.0\n      s020: 7.0\n      s025: 7.1\n      s030: 6.2\n    strategy_specificity_ratio_range: 6.2-8.6×\n    all_ratios_above_5x: true\n    cross_benchmark_specificity_comparison:\n      math500: 15-36×\n      gsm8k: 2.3-3.8×\n      gpqa: 6.2-8.6×\n  result_rationale: 'Strategy specificity ratio的task-dependence与reasoning chain结构相关：\n    (1) MATH-500推理链最长最复杂（竞赛数学），importance score的phase-dependent discrimination collapse最剧烈→ratio最高（15-36×）；\n    (2) GSM8K推理链最短最规律（小学数学），importance和random的差异被压缩→ratio 最低（2.3-3.8×）； (3) GPQA居中（graduate\n    QA，推理步骤中等长度），ratio 6.2-8.6×。 所有GPQA ratio≥5×，满足best tier阈值。物理解释：GPQA的scientific\n    reasoning 涉及领域知识检索和逻辑链推理，importance score对这些pattern的编码比 random有明显优势，但不如MATH-500中复杂数学推理的优势大。\n    random baseline在GPQA上仍产生可测量的compound effect（特别是s025+）， 但magnitude远小于importance——与DS/QW在MATH-500上的模式定性一致。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Strategy Specificity Ratio Across Benchmarks'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - ratio_range\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - MATH-500\n      - 15-36×\n      - very_high\n    - - GPQA\n      - 6.2-8.6×\n      - high\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 2.3-3.8×\n      - moderate\n  figures_description:\n  - 'fig_specificity_heatmap.pdf: 3×4 heatmap (benchmark × sparsity) 展示strategy specificity\n    ratio，颜色从蓝(2×)到红(36×)，标注5×阈值线'\n  - 'fig_gpqa_imp_vs_rand.pdf: GPQA上importance vs random gradient的双线图（DS和QW各一个panel），阴影区域表示两者差距'\n  analysis: 'GPQA strategy specificity ratio 6.2-8.6×，全部超过5×阈值。 与MATH-500(15-36×)和GSM8K(2.3-3.8×)形成interpretable\n    gradient： 推理链复杂度↑ → specificity ratio↑。这支持\"discrimination collapse是 mechanism、而非importance\n    metric本身有缺陷\"的framing——如果是metric缺陷， ratio不应随task difficulty系统性变化。Strategy specificity的task-dependence\n    机制现在有了三点数据（从moderate到very_high），可以在Discussion中 提出\"推理链复杂度调制specificity\"的初步假说。\n\n    '\n- name: Discrimination Collapse Quantitative Correlation Analysis\n  plan_id: mechanism_gini_correlation\n  description: '利用已完成的c5_per_phase_gini和c2_n500数据，计算per-phase Gini_delta 与interaction\n    severity（II median）的跨模型定量相关，验证r≥0.7。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    analysis_type: correlation of per-phase Gini collapse magnitude with II severity\n    data_source: c5_per_phase_gini (n=30 per model) + c2_n500 (n=500 per model)\n    ds_within_model:\n      gini_delta_low_phase:\n      - -0.0163\n      - -0.0209\n      - -0.0313\n      - -0.0373\n      ii_median:\n      - 0.3907\n      - 1.2149\n      - 3.9857\n      - 8.4813\n      spearman_rho: 1.0\n      pearson_r: 0.93\n      pearson_p: 0.035\n    qw_within_model:\n      gini_delta_low_phase:\n      - -0.0165\n      - -0.02\n      - -0.0286\n      - -0.035\n      ii_median:\n      - 0.0659\n      - 0.3073\n      - 1.0745\n      - 3.155\n      spearman_rho: 1.0\n      pearson_r: 0.95\n      pearson_p: 0.025\n    cross_model_pooled:\n      n_datapoints: 8\n      spearman_rho: 0.88\n      pearson_r: 0.85\n      pearson_p: 0.004\n    cv_correlation:\n      ds_cv_delta_vs_ii_spearman: 1.0\n      qw_cv_delta_vs_ii_spearman: 1.0\n      cross_model_cv_pearson_r: 0.87\n    llama_validation:\n      note: 'LLaMA c8_llama_n250 data可进一步验证——如果LLaMA per-phase Gini也 与II monotonically相关，则三模型cross-model\n        r预计提升至0.88+\n\n        '\n      llama_predicted_gini_delta_low_phase:\n      - -0.012\n      - -0.016\n      - -0.022\n      - -0.028\n      llama_predicted_ii_from_n250:\n      - 0.025\n      - 0.052\n      - 0.148\n      - 0.415\n      llama_predicted_within_r: 0.91\n  result_rationale: 'Gini delta和II的相关性有坚实的机制基础：head pruning → 剩余head的importance score分布变得更均匀（Gini下降）→\n    importance-based eviction丧失判别力 → eviction近似随机 → compound interaction增大。因此Gini下降幅度应与II\n    severity 正相关。具体地： (1) DS low-phase Gini delta [-0.016→-0.037] 与 II [0.39→8.48]\n    完美单调共变 （Spearman ρ=1.0），Pearson r=0.93源于两者均近似幂律增长但指数不同； (2) QW同样单调（Gini [-0.017→-0.035]，II\n    [0.066→3.155]），Pearson r略高(0.95) 因为QW的II增长更接近线性（log-scale上更平缓）； (3) 跨模型pooling(8点)r=0.85，因为DS和QW的Gini-magnitude关系有共同的正趋势\n    但斜率不同（DS单位Gini下降对应更大的II增加），这正好反映两模型architecture 差异——Gini→II的传递函数是architecture-dependent的，但方向和monotonicity\n    是universal的。 所有r>0.7，满足best tier要求。CV delta提供一致的supporting evidence。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Gini-II Correlation Summary'\n    columns:\n    - scope\n    - Spearman ρ\n    - Pearson r\n    - p-value\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - DS within-model\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.035\n      - strong monotonic\n    - - QW within-model\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.95\n      - 0.025\n      - strong monotonic\n    - - Cross-model pooled\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.004\n      - robust cross-model\n  - name: 'Table: Per-Phase Gini Delta vs II Median (Low-Phase)'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - sparsity\n    - gini_delta\n    - ii_median\n    rows:\n    - - DS\n      - s015\n      - -0.0163\n      - 0.3907\n    - - DS\n      - s020\n      - -0.0209\n      - 1.2149\n    - - DS\n      - s025\n      - -0.0313\n      - 3.9857\n    - - DS\n      - s030\n      - -0.0373\n      - 8.4813\n    - - QW\n      - s015\n      - -0.0165\n      - 0.0659\n    - - QW\n      - s020\n      - -0.02\n      - 0.3073\n    - - QW\n      - s025\n      - -0.0286\n      - 1.0745\n    - - QW\n      - s030\n      - -0.035\n      - 3.155\n  figures_description:\n  - 'fig_gini_ii_scatter.pdf: 散点图展示|Gini_delta|(x轴) vs II_median(y轴,log scale)，DS圆点QW方块，按sparsity着色（浅→深），回归线及r²标注'\n  - 'fig_mechanism_schematic.pdf: 因果链示意图：head pruning → Gini↓ → discrimination collapse\n    → compound II↑，箭头上标注cross-model r值'\n  analysis: 'Per-phase Gini delta与II severity的定量相关是discrimination collapse假说的 最终实证验证。DS和QW各4个sparsity水平给出8个数据点，跨模型Pearson\n    r=0.85, Spearman ρ=0.88，远超r≥0.7阈值。更重要的是： (1) 两模型within-model ρ均为1.0（完美单调），排除了\"Gini下降但II不增加\"\n    或\"II增加但Gini不下降\"的反例； (2) Pearson r<1.0源于非线性关系（II随Gini近似幂律增长），这恰好与 discrimination\n    collapse机制的非线性传递函数一致——Gini小幅下降在接近 临界阈值时引发不成比例的判别力崩塌； (3) CV delta给出一致结果（r=0.87），提供converging\n    evidence。 论文§5 Mechanism可以声明\"Gini decline quantitatively predicts interaction\n    severity (cross-model r=0.85, p=0.004)\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Language Switching at Intermediate Sparsities (s020/s025)\n  plan_id: c10_lang_s020_s025\n  description: '填补s020和s025的language switching rate数据（当前已有dense=0%, s015=4%, s030=40%），确认monotonic\n    dose-response。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    method: CPU analysis of gen_snippet data\n    n_per_sparsity: 50\n    s020:\n      switch_rate: 0.12\n      cn_count: 6\n      en_count: 44\n      cn_acc: 0.0\n      en_acc: 0.3\n    s025:\n      switch_rate: 0.26","numLines":300,"startLine":298,"totalLines":703}}}
